# =============================================================================
#  MMC-TST.orch - MPAI Text and Speech Translation (MMC-TST-V2.5)
#  Workflow Description Language v0.3, AIF V3.0
#
#  One Controller, one Module. The User Agent offers the Controller data
#  identified by Data Type and Port Number, and asks for data identified the
#  same way. It names no AIM.
#
#  The person chooses the language spoken and the language of the translation -
#  one Language Selector carries both - then speaks or types; the Module gives
#  the translated Text Object, which is shown, and the translated Speech Object,
#  which is played. Acquisition and delivery are the User Agent's (the TST
#  specification: they are not SubAIMs of the Composite AIM).
# =============================================================================

workflow MMC-TST over 1MMC-TST-V2.5-I01

on Start:

    ask Controller to start

    acquire Languages (OSD-SEL-V1.5)

    loop until Stop:

        acquire UserSpeech (OSD-BSO-V1.5) via VAD
             or UserText   (OSD-BTO-V1.5)
        offer Languages (OSD-SEL-V1.5:1)
        branch on UserText {
            offer UserText (OSD-BTO-V1.5)
        } else {
            offer UserSpeech (OSD-BSO-V1.5)
        }
        ask   TranslatedText (OSD-BTO-V1.5), TranslatedSpeech (OSD-BSO-V1.5)
        display TranslatedText
        present TranslatedSpeech

on Stop:

    ask Controller to stop
